on <i>www.sec.gov</i>. You can also find information on our website www.zjk-industrial.com. The information contained on our website is
not a part of this annual report.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">&#160;</p>

