<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt"><i>Exercise of Awards.</i> The
plan administrator determines the exercise or purchase price, as applicable, the payment methods, and the time or times of exercise for
each award, which are stated in the relevant award agreement. However, the maximum exercisable term for an option is ten years from the
date of grant (or five years for incentive stock options granted to a 10% owner).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt"><i>Transfer Restrictions.</i> Awards
may not be transferred in any manner by the participant other than in accordance with the exceptions provided in the 2025 Equity Incentive
Plan, applicable law, or the relevant award agreement. For example, incentive stock options are non-transferable except by will or the
laws of descent and distribution, while nonqualified stock options may be transferred to family members if provided in the agreement or
approved by the committee.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt"><i>Clawback, Anti-Hedging and Anti-Pledging.</i>
All awards granted under the 2025 Equity Incentive Plan are subject to recoupment in accordance with any clawback, recovery, or recoupment
policy we may adopt, including repayment or forfeiture in the event of certain financial restatements. Furthermore, covered individuals
are prohibited from hedging their ownership positions in our ordinary shares, pledging shares as collateral for loans, or purchasing our
ordinary shares on margin.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt"><i>Termination and Amendment.</i>
The 2025 Equity Incentive Plan became effective on June 20, 2025, and unless terminated earlier, has a term of ten years from its effective
date. Our board of directors may at any time terminate, amend, or modify the 2025 Equity Incentive Plan, subject to the approval of our
shareholders for any amendment that is required by applicable law, regulation, or stock exchange rules.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b>Compensation Recovery Policy</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">In April 2025, we adopted a Compensation
Recovery Policy in compliance with the SEC rules and The Nasdaq Stock Market listing standards to recover any excess incentive-based compensation
from current and former executive officers after an accounting restatement.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">&#160;</p>

