<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b>Board of Directors</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">Our board of directors consists
of five directors. A director is not required to hold any shares in our company to qualify to serve as a director. A director may vote
with respect to any contract, proposed contract, or arrangement in which he or she is materially interested, provided that such director
discloses to their fellow directors the nature and extent of any material interest or duty in accordance with our Articles. The directors
may exercise all the powers of the Company to borrow money, mortgage its business, property and uncalled capital and issue debentures
or other securities whenever money is borrowed or as security for any obligation of the company or of any third party.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">&#160;</p>

