<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 18pt; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s reporting currency is the United
States dollar (&#8220;US$&#8221;). The functional currency of Zhongjinke, Zhongjinke BVI, Zhongjinke HK, and ZJK Precision HK is US$,
the functional currency of its PRC subsidiaries is the Renminbi (&#8220;RMB&#8221;) and the functional currency of ZJK Precision Vietnam
is the Vietnamese Dong (&#8220;VND&#8221;).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

