<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 18pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">Other non-current assets consist of prepayments for
property and equipment and rental deposits with a balance of US$<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--OtherAssetsNoncurrent_iI_c20251231_zzYqCbuceiwj" title="Other non-current asset"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherAssetsNoncurrent" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" id="Fact001237" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">347,569</ix:nonFraction></span> as of December 31, 2025. In November 2024, the Company entered
into a manufacturing equipment purchase agreement in a total amount of US$<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--OtherAssetsNoncurrent_iI_c20241130__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--ThirdPartyMember_z7wOGGskUim1" title="Other non-current asset"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherAssetsNoncurrent" contextRef="AsOf2024-11-30_custom_ThirdPartyMember" id="Fact001239" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> with a third party and prepaid an amount of US$1,000,020&#160;&#160;&#160;.
The Company recorded impairment loss of nil and US$<span id="xdx_906_ecustom--ImpairmentLoss_c20250101__20251231_zjoDApqXcMO2" title="Impairment loss"><span id="xdx_903_ecustom--ImpairmentLoss_c20240101__20241231_zioFEUVLslk2" title="Impairment loss"><ix:nonFraction name="ZJK:ImpairmentLoss" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001241" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="ZJK:ImpairmentLoss" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31" id="Fact001243" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,000,020</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>&#160;&#160; for the years ended December 31, 2024 and 2025, respectively,
as the Company concluded the likelihood of the balance being recovered is remote. The impairment loss on prepayments is recognized within
general and administrative expenses in the consolidated statements of income and comprehensive income. The remaining balance as of December
31, 2025 relates to prepayments to nine equipment suppliers and venue rental deposits. Delivery of the equipment is expected in December
2026.&#160;&#160;</p>

