    <td style="width: 98%">
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">On October 18, 2024, Zhongjinke Shenzhen obtained
    a short-term borrowing from China Merchants Bank Shenzhen Branch amounting to RMB<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_uRMB_c20241018__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__custom--ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember_zxqqyzhPuL4j" title="Short term borrowings"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2024-10-18_custom_ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember" id="Fact001427" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="RMB">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> (equivalent to US$<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_uUSD_c20241018__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__custom--ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember_zTk3FOXTwqYi" title="Short term borrowings"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2024-10-18_custom_ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember" id="Fact001429" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">695,091</ix:nonFraction></span>) with an annual interest
    of 3.00% and the balance has been fully repaid on January 20, 2025.</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">On November 29, 2024, Zhongjinke Shenzhen obtained
    a short-term borrowing from China Merchants Bank Shenzhen Branch amounting to RMB<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_uRMB_c20241129__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__custom--ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember_z7geq9cuBAJ3" title="Short term borrowings"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2024-11-29_custom_ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember" id="Fact001431" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="RMB">4,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span> (equivalent to US$<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_uUSD_c20241129__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__custom--ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember_z8geBCAmptgh" title="Short term borrowings"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2024-11-29_custom_ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember" id="Fact001433" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">625,582</ix:nonFraction></span>) with an annual interest
    of 2.90% and the balance has been fully repaid on February 5, 2025.</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">On May 30, 2025, Zhongjinke Shenzhen obtained a short-term
    borrowing from China Merchants Bank Shenzhen Branch amounting to RMB<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_uRMB_c20250530__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__custom--ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember_zJzieFFYOiGk" title="Short term borrowings"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2025-05-30_custom_ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember" id="Fact001435" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="RMB">10,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;(equivalent to US$<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_uUSD_c20250530__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__custom--ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember_zXxBoEXXMTk7" title="Short term borrowings"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2025-05-30_custom_ChinaMerchantsBankShenzhenBranchMember" id="Fact001437" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,394,545</ix:nonFraction></span>) with an annual interest
    of 2.20% and the balance has been fully repaid on December 1, 2025.</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">These borrowings obtained in 2024 and 2025 were all
    guaranteed by related parties, Ning Ding and Baozhen Zhu.</p></td></tr>
