<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">For the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025,
the Company&#8217;s short-term bank borrowings bear a weighted average interest rate of <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ShortTermDebtWeightedAverageInterestRate_iI_dp_c20231231_zzlhhfOBq1z3" title="Weighted average interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermDebtWeightedAverageInterestRate" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" id="Fact001439" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Ratio">3.99</ix:nonFraction></span>%, <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShortTermDebtWeightedAverageInterestRate_iI_dp_c20241231_zGeUlPApLPzk" title="Weighted average interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermDebtWeightedAverageInterestRate" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31" id="Fact001441" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Ratio">3.62</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShortTermDebtWeightedAverageInterestRate_iI_dp_c20251231_zZuNy66Ggz69" title="Weighted average interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermDebtWeightedAverageInterestRate" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" id="Fact001443" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Ratio">2.18</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum, respectively.
